The objective of this assignment is to implement a Transformer-based NLP model for the given task using Hugging Face libraries. Students will fine-tune or evaluate the specified model(s), report performance, and analyze the results.

## Task
Sequence pair classification

## Description
Fine-tune a model for semantic textual similarity as a regression problem. Predict similarity score between two sentences.

## Dataset
Use the following Hugging Face dataset: glue, stsb

## Models to be Used
Use the following model(s): bert-base-uncased, sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
If more than one model is listed, compare their performance.

## Implementation Requirements
Students must implement:
1. Dataset loading using Hugging Face `datasets`
2. Data preprocessing and tokenization
3. Model loading using Hugging Face `transformers`
4. Fine-tuning or inference pipeline
5. Evaluation using the required metric(s)
6. Prediction on at least 5 custom examples
7. Error analysis

## Metric
Evaluate the model using:
Accuracy
Precision
Recall
F1-Score